---
slug: api/uploads
method: post
---
{% comment %}
  Stores a file uploaded on test/upload, the way an app does after an upload, and returns
  the url platformOS serves it from - the tests read the uploaded files from there.
{% endcomment %}
{% liquid
  graphql result = 'uploads/store', upload: context.params.upload
  echo result.record_create.file
%}
